{
  "workflowId": "300000331058602",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_WIS_KANBAN_WORKSPACE_PLANNING_ADVISOR",
  "name": "Kanban Planning Agent",
  "description": "This agent team supports kanban planning and optimization by determining the optimal number of kanban cards required for items and pull sequences in a manufacturing or supply chain environment.\n\nIt helps users analyze current kanban performance, identify shortages or excess cards, and recommend adjustments to maintain smooth material flow. The agent can evaluate kanban health across items, detect risks such as insufficient ready cards, and highlight pull sequences that require attention.\n\nUsers can run the kanban planning engine on demand to assess current conditions, or schedule it to run automatically at defined intervals to continuously monitor and optimize kanban card levels.\n\nThis agent team is best suited for questions and workflows related to kanban card sizing, pull sequence health, and proactive kanban optimization.",
  "specification": {
